# Regeneration (CR 701.19a, 614.8) is a destruction-replacement effect, ordered by the permanent's controller with the others
# that would change the event (CR 616.1). Bot1 begins with Leyline of the Void. On turn 5 Bot1 Bolts Bot2's Llanowar Elves and
# Bot2 regenerates them with Yavimaya Hollow in response; the lethal damage destroys them (CR 704.5g), and Bot2 takes the
# Leyline's exile first: the Elves are exiled rather than put into a graveyard, so the event is no destruction any more (CR
# 614.6) and the shield does not apply. The positive control is
# assassins-trophy-regenerated-creature-lives-and-its-controller-still-fetches, the shield alone.

[Bot1 Deck]
Leyline of the Void
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Yavimaya Hollow
Forest x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Yavimaya Hollow.Play
Bot2.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Yavimaya Hollow.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves; Ability: Regenerate)
Bot2.Replace(Leyline of the Void)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Exile = Llanowar Elves
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest; Yavimaya Hollow
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
